{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000130985","approvedSymbol":"UBA1","functionDescriptions":["Catalyzes the first step in ubiquitin conjugation to mark cellular proteins for degradation through the ubiquitin-proteasome system (PubMed:1447181, PubMed:1606621, PubMed:33108101). Activates ubiquitin by first adenylating its C-terminal glycine residue with ATP, and thereafter linking this residue to the side chain of a cysteine residue in E1, yielding a ubiquitin-E1 thioester and free AMP (PubMed:1447181). Essential for the formation of radiation-induced foci, timely DNA repair and for response to replication stress. Promotes the recruitment of TP53BP1 and BRCA1 at DNA damage sites (PubMed:22456334). {ECO:0000269|PubMed:1447181, ECO:0000269|PubMed:1606621, ECO:0000269|PubMed:22456334, ECO:0000269|PubMed:33108101}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"P22314","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A024R1A3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5JRR6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5JRR9","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5JRS0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5JRS1","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5JRS2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"Q5JRS3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000338413","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000366481","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000366568","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000389583","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000397816","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000401101","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000404796","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000415033","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000550229","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000550230","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000550231","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000550232","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000550233","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000550234","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000550235","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000550236","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000550237","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"